EcoVideo Open-Source Release Notice

This repository contains EcoVideo original code and selected vendored third-party
components required for the text-to-video inference path.

Vendored components:
- third_party/wan21/wan: Wan2.1-derived T2V code, modified for entropy-based keyframe selection and non-key context support.
- third_party/wan22/wan: Wan2.2-derived T2V code, modified for entropy-based keyframe selection and non-key context support.
- third_party/raft: RAFT-derived optical-flow code used optionally for interval scoring.

Before making the repository public, add the exact upstream repository URLs,
original license files, and a file-level summary of modifications for each
vendored component. Do not apply the EcoVideo project license to third-party
code unless the upstream license permits it.
